      "evalb_memo_en": "Title: My favorite song\nPresentation time: 5 mins\nPresenters must prepare presentation pages, PPT or other softwares are okay. \n\nTell us what’s your favorite English song, your presentation must include:\n1. Song title\n2. Artist\n3. Creator of lyrics and music\n4. Year of publish\n5. What is about of this song?\n6. Why do you love this song? What touches you?",
