      "evalb_memo": null,
      "evalb_memo_en": "Mid-term Presentation \nChoose one subculture/style for final presentation, then research and study this style until you become a gig  \nPresentation time: 10 mins\nPresentation pages are required \n \nYour presentation must include: \n1. What subculture/style did you choose?\n2. A brief history when the subculture/style was born\n3. Iconic artist and works of this subculture/style\n4. Visual characteristics and dress code of subculture/style",
      "evalb_name": "期中考",
      "evalb_name_en": "Midterm examination",
