      "evalb_memo_en": "Final Presentation \nTheme: Marketing something with subculture styles \nPresentation time: 10 mins\nPresentation pages are required  \n\nYour presentation must include: \n1. A product or a brand\n2. A short brief of the product, and what style you choose to marketing this product, WHY??\n3. Make a 30sec to 1 min commercial film",
